                                "sense_id": "29e58401-3e30-3f74-a9da-f99cd7fcbd14",
                                "text": "The spot was bright and lively now; but in winter it became necessary to place sandbags against the door, and to stuff up the keyhole against the wind and rain, which had worn the paint so thin that the priming and knotting showed through."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
